{c: Verse 1}
[A]Jaane tere [D]shehar ka [A]kya iraada [D]hai
[A]Jaane tere [D]shehar ka [A]kya iraada [D]hai,        [G]Aasmaan [A]kam.. [Bm] ,
[D]parindey zyada [A]hain,        O [A]Jaane tere [D]shehar ka [A]kya iraada [D]hai
[D]Khushi ka hissa [A]Gham ka hissa,        [D]Ghoont ka hissa [A]Dum ka hissa
[G]Zakhm aur marham ka [D]hissa,        [F]Dil-farosi ka ye qissa
[A]Jaane tera [D]ishq bhi [A]Kya tamasha [D]hai
[A]Jaane tera [D]ishq bhi [A]Kya tamasha [D]hai,        [G]Raat ko [A]mulzim.. [Bm]
[D]Din mein Khuda saa [A]hai,        [A]Jaane tere [D]shehar ka [A]kya iraada [D]hai
[D]Jaane hum pe kaun si aisi [A]tohmat hai
[D]Samajh na paayein aib hai yaa ye [A]aadat hai
[G]Malmal mein lipte hain,        Phir bhi [D]bikhre hain
[F]Bas ye jaam humara hai, [C]hum iske hain
[A]Yun toh mera [D]dard hi [A]ik dawa saa [D]hai
[A]Yun toh mera [D]dard hi [A]ik dawa saa [D]hai,        [G]Har ghadi [A]zinda.. [Bm]
[D]har din naya saa [A]hai,        [A]Jaane tere [D]shehar ka [A]kya iraada [D]hai
